# Cloudflare Caching Headers to ensure instant updates without stale cache issues
/index.html
  Cache-Control: no-cache, no-store, must-revalidate, max-age=0

/*.js
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable

/*.css
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable

/assets/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable
